<title>CHINA: China expected to ok Shell petchem venture in H1.</title>
<headline>China expected to ok Shell petchem venture in H1.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's State Planning Commission is expected to approve a joint petrochemical venture with Royal Dutch/Shell Group in the first half of 1997, said a spokesman for the China National Offshore Oil Corp (CNOOC), a partner in the project.</p>
</text>
